"""
hardn-tui — HARDN RELOADED Security Dashboard

A live TUI overview of all security tools installed by HARDN RELOADED.

Usage:
  sudo hardn-tui

Requires: python-textual
  Arch:    sudo pacman -S python-textual
  Debian:  sudo apt install python3-textual   # or: pip install textual
  RPM:     pip install textual

Keys:  r — refresh   q — quit
"""
